# The UK1 character GLB is ~478 MB, far over GitHub's 100 MB hard limit.
# Host it as a GitHub Release asset (up to 2 GB per file, unlimited bandwidth)
# instead of committing it. The ipad.html "Load UK1" button will try
# ./uk1_outboxer.glb first (works locally), then fall back gracefully.
uk1_outboxer.glb

# Conversion artifacts (large, regenerable)
_convert_uk1.log

